Assigned scope:
Implement UX-11, explicitly addressing ADR 0001's reminder deferral before implementation. Freeze a bounded desktop-local reminder contract: time/timezone, default if-no-reply versus regardless, unscheduled someday, qualifying reply/source baseline, DST parsing, cancellation/reschedule races and incoming-message behavior. Persist scheduling and distinct pending/returned membership; coordinate inbox removal/return via durable intents. Reconcile replies before asserting no reply; offline/incomplete evidence is not proof. Execute while running and idempotently reconcile overdue work on launch; no execution promise while fully quit or cross-device, no calendar. Add H picker and usable pending/returned destinations only with real support. Fake clock/provider/restart tests: fire once, reply suppresses conditional but not regardless, someday never fires, cancellation/failure/new-mail races, exact targets and recovery. If safe semantics need approval beyond this request, ask rather than bypass the gate.

